# Cloudflare Pages rewrites. A 200 serves the target with the address left
# as it was, so /@jason stays /@jason in the bar.
#
# A public racer profile: profile.html reads the username out of the path and
# asks the worker for that profile. /u/ is the same page for anywhere an
# address starting with @ is awkward to type or link.
/@*    /profile    200
/u/*   /profile    200
